<title>HONG KONG: Lehman proposes Hongkong Land warrants.</title>
<headline>Lehman proposes Hongkong Land warrants.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lehman Brothers said on Tuesday it intended to issue 20 million call warrants on shares of Hongkong Land Holdings.</p>
<p>One warrant control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	US$2.772	  PREMIUM   13.1 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	 US$0.712	  GEARING   4.33X</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	  18 MTHS AFTER LAUNCH</p>
<p> PAYDATE	     4 WKS AFTER LAUNCH</p>
<p> LISTING	     SINGAPORE	 LISTING DATE   N/C</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE    N/A</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6441</p>
</text>
